---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import ContactCTA from "../../components/ContactCTA.astro"
import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro"
---
<BaseLayout title="November Events | Side Quests Colorado" description="November 2026 Events">
	<div class="stack gap-20">
		<main class="wrapper about">
			<Hero
				title="November 2026 Book Club Events"
				tagline="Check out the cool events you can go to in November."
			>
				<img
					width="1553"
					height="873"
					src="/assets/november-books.png"
					alt="A black woman reading."
				/>
    </Hero>
<section>
		<h2 class="section-title">Book Clubs</h2>
		<div class="content">
			<h3>Arapahoe Library Book Clubs</h3>
				<p>Arapahoe County Libraries have several book clubs meeting this month. <a href="https://arapahoelibraries.bibliocommons.com/v2/events?_gl=1*oak0h7*_ga*MjQ2MzU1ODA5LjE3ODU1ODc2OTM.*_ga_G99DMMNG39*czE3OTM2NTQyODUkbzIkZzEkdDE3OTM2NTQ1MDUkajU5JGwwJGgw*_ga_F2558DXSQK*czE3OTM2NTQyODUkbzIkZzEkdDE3OTM2NTQ1MDUkajUzJGwwJGgw&types=5cd1e0dde53b5124003276eb" target="_blank">Visit the Arapahoe Libraries Events page</a> to find out more and register.</p>
				<p>
					<ul>
						<li><span class="date">Nov 3 2 PM:</span> Castlewood Afternoon Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 4 7 PM: Castlewood LGBTQ+ Book Club and Social</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 5 6:30 PM: Koebel Nonfiction Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 6 12 PM: Sheridan First Friday Food, Fiction, and Fidgets Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 9 7 PM: Smokey Hills Evening Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 10 6 PM: Kelver Adult Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 16 6 PM: Davies Adult Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 18 2 PM: Smokey Hills Afternoon Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 18 6:30 PM: Koebel Mystery Book Club</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 18 7PM: Virtual Books on Tap at Home</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 19 9 AM: Southglenn Early Birds Book Club and Social</li>
						<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 24 6:30 PM: Koebel Fiction Book Club</li>
					</ul>
				</p>
		</div>
		<div class="content">
			<h3>Douglas County Library Book Clubs</h3>
				<p>Douglas County Libraries have several book clubs meeting this month. <a href="https://go.dcl.org/events?t=%255B%2522Book%2520Club%2522%255D&n=12&r=range&start=2026-11-02&end=2027-11-30" target=_blank">Visit the DCL events page</a> to learn more and to register. </p>
				<p>
					<ul>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 3 10 AM: Highlands Ranch Daytime Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 3 5 PM: Lone Tree Dungeons and Dragons Gaming and Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 3 6 PM: Parker Inklings Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 3 6 PM: Quiet Reading Group</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 4 5:30 PM: Highlands Ranch ESL Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 4 6 PM: Parker The Book Was Better - Or Was It? Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 4 6:30 PM: Lone Tree Book Banter Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 5 11:30 AM: Lone Tree Reader's Roost Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 5 6 PM: Castle Pines Quiet Reading Group</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 5 6:30 PM: Highlands Ranch Mystery Loves Company Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 5 7 PM: Virtual Great Books Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 9 6 PM: Castle Rock Know Thy Self Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 9 6:30 PM: Highlands Ranch Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 11 6 PM: Roxborough Fiction Fusion Book Club</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span>Nov 12 6PM: Highlands Ranch Qiet Reading Group</li>
					<li><span class="date"></span></li>
					<li><span class="date"></span></li>
					</ul>
				</p>
		</div>
		<div class="content">
			<h3>Front Range Library Book Clubs</h3>
				<p></p>
				<p>
					<ul>
						<li><span class="date"></span></li>
						<li><span class="date"></span></li>
					</ul>
				</p>
		</div>
			<div class="content">
			<h3>Other Book Clubs</h3>
				<p></p>
				<p>
					<ul>
						<li><span class="date"></span></li>
						<li><span class="date"></span></li>
					</ul>
				</p>
		</div>
			</section>
<section>
				<h2 class="section-title">Disclaimers</h2>
				<div class="content">
				<p>
						Coming soon
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
      </main>

		<ContactCTA />
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.date {
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.about {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3.5rem;
	}

	img {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
	}

	section {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--gray-200);
	}

	.section-title {
		grid-column-start: 1;
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		color: var(--gray-0);
	}

	.content {
		grid-column: 2 / 4;
	}

	.content :global(a) {
		text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
		text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
		transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
	}

	.content :global(a:hover),
	.content :global(a:focus) {
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		h3 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}
		.about {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
		}

		.about > :global(:first-child) {
			grid-column-start: 2;
		}

		section {
			display: contents;
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}
	}
</style>